      "msgs": [
        {
          "body": "哟，我这刚出炉的枣泥酥还烫着手呢，周公文你来得巧，先尝一块——你说铁头他们几个抢那紧俏货，犯得着天不亮就去排队么？",
          "body_len": 57,
          "day": 0,
          "from": "P004",
          "line": 3122,
          "msg_uid": "42:3121",
          "place": "market",
          "reply_to": null,
          "round": 4,
          "seq": 3121,
          "slot": "afternoon",
          "to": "P013",
          "topic": "scarce_buy",
          "turn": 0,
          "type": "MSG_DM"
        },
        {
          "body": "抢啥抢，我这儿还锤着张屠户的菜刀没淬火呢。排一宿队，值当？",
          "body_len": 29,
          "day": 0,
          "from": "P013",
          "line": 5066,
          "msg_uid": "42:5065",
          "place": "cafe",
          "reply_to": "42:3121",
          "round": 6,
          "seq": 5065,
          "slot": "evening",
          "to": "P004",
          "topic": "scarce_buy",
          "turn": 1,
          "type": "MSG_DM"
        },
        {
          "body": "你那菜刀还等着淬火，我这儿刚把张屠户订的桃酥装进纸袋，倒惦记着抢紧俏货的事呢。",
          "body_len": 39,
          "day": 0,
          "from": "P004",
          "line": 5733,
          "msg_uid": "42:5732",
          "place": "community_center",
          "reply_to": "42:5065",
          "round": 7,
          "seq": 5732,
          "slot": "evening",
          "to": "P013",
          "topic": "scarce_buy",
          "turn": 2,
          "type": "MSG_DM"
        },
        {
          "body": "这日子过得，炉子里那块铁还红着呢，张屠户下午就来取刀。",
          "body_len": 27,
          "day": 0,
          "from": "P013",
          "line": 7845,
          "msg_uid": "42:7844",
          "place": "cafe",
          "reply_to": "42:5732",
          "round": 8,
          "seq": 7844,
          "slot": "evening",
          "to": "P004",
          "topic": "scarce_buy",
          "turn": 3,
          "type": "MSG_DM"
        },
        {
          "body": "桃酥刚装好，张屠户下午来取，我这儿还一炉蛋黄酥等着出炉呢。紧俏货抢不抢的，先尝块酥。",
          "body_len": 42,
          "day": 0,
          "from": "P004",
          "line": 8200,
          "msg_uid": "42:8199",
          "place": "residence",
          "reply_to": "42:7844",
          "round": 9,
          "seq": 8199,
          "slot": "night",
          "to": "P013",
          "topic": "scarce_buy",
          "turn": 4,
          "type": "MSG_DM"
        },
        {
          "body": "秀娘，紧俏货抢不抢的，我这铁砧上还压着张屠户的刀坯，得先锤完这三十下。",
          "body_len": 35,
          "day": 0,
          "from": "P013",
          "line": 15594,
          "msg_uid": "42:15593",
          "place": "residence",
          "reply_to": "42:8199",
